Attack description : https://femfortress.com/224-2/

detection Rule : 
index=streamfwd sourcetype="stream:dns" app=dns
src="EXTERNAL_DNS_SERVER_IP"
| eventstats values(message_type) as type by flow_id
| eval flag=if(match(type,"RESPONSE")
    AND NOT match(type,"QUERY"),1,0)
| search flag=1


An indication of this attack is observing a large number of DNS responses without corresponding DNS queries. 
For each flow_id, only a DNS response is present, with no associated query.
The search returns all such events. 
By configuring an alert condition and setting a threshold—for example, more than 10 occurrences within a two-minute window—the alert will be triggered when the threshold is exceeded.
